":8799},{"t":": Que te ferons","s":6213,"m":8799},{"t":"-nous, pour que la mer","s":3220},{"t":"se calme","s":8367,"m":8799},{"t":"envers nous ? Car la mer","s":3220},{"t":"était de plus en plus","s":1980,"m":8802},{"t":"orageuse","s":5590,"m":8802},{"t":"."}]},{"v":12,"t":"Il leur répondit: Prenez -moi, et jetez -moi dans la mer, et la mer se calmera envers vous; car je sais que c’est moi qui attire sur vous cette grande tempête.","s":[{"t":"Il leur répondit","s":559,"m":8799},{"t":": Prenez","s":5375,"m":8798},{"t":"-moi, et jetez","s":2904,"m":8685},{"t":"-moi dans la mer","s":3220},{"t":", et la mer","s":3220},{"t":"se calmera","s":8367,"m":8799},{"t":"envers vous ; car je sais","s":3045,"m":8802},{"t":"que c’est moi","s":7945},{"t":"qui attire sur vous cette grande","s":1419},{"t":"tempête","s":5591},{"t":"."}]},{"v":13,"t":"Ces hommes ramaient pour gagner la terre, mais ils ne le purent, parce que la mer s’agitait toujours plus contre eux.","s":[{"t":"Ces hommes","s":582},{"t":"ramaient","s":2864,"m":8799},{"t":"pour gagner","s":7725,"m":8687},{"t":"la terre","s":3004},{"t":", mais ils ne le purent","s":3201,"m":8804},{"t":", parce que la mer","s":3220},{"t":"s’agitait","s":5590,"m":8802},{"t":"toujours plus","s":1980,"m":8802},{"t":"contre eux."}]},{"v":14,"t":"Alors ils invoquèrent l’Éternel, et dirent: O Éternel, ne nous fais pas périr à cause de la vie de cet homme, et ne nous charge Pas du sang innocent! Car toi, Éternel, tu fais ce que tu veux.","s":[{"t":"Alors ils invoquèrent","s":7121,"m":8799},{"t":"l’Éternel","s":3068},{"t":", et dirent","s":559,"m":8799},{"t":": O","s":577},{"t":"Éternel","s":3068},{"t":", ne nous fais pas périr","s":6,"m":8799},{"t":"à cause de la vie","s":5315},{"t":"de cet homme","s":376},{"t":", et ne nous charge","s":5414,"m":8799},{"t":"Pas du sang","s":1818},{"t":"innocent","s":5355,"m":8675},{"t":"","s":5355},{"t":"! Car toi, Éternel","s":3068},{"t":", tu fais","s":6213,"m":8804},{"t":"ce que tu veux","s":2654,"m":8804},{"t":"."}]},{"v":15,"t":"Puis ils prirent Jonas, et le jetèrent dans la mer. Et la fureur de la mer s’apaisa.","s":[{"t":"Puis ils prirent","s":5375,"m":8799},{"t":"Jonas","s":3124},{"t":", et le jetèrent","s":2904,"m":8686},{"t":"dans la mer","s":3220},{"t":". Et la fureur","s":2197},{"t":"de la mer","s":3220},{"t":"s’apaisa","s":5975,"m":8799},{"t":"."}]},{"v":16,"t":"Ces hommes furent saisis d’une grande crainte de l’Éternel, et ils offrirent un sacrifice à l’Éternel, et firent des vœux.","s":[{"t":"Ces hommes","s":582},{"t":"furent saisis d’une grande","s":1419},{"t":"","s":3374},{"t":"crainte","s":3372,"m":8799},{"t":"de l’Éternel","s":3068},{"t":", et ils offrirent","s":2076,"m":8799},{"t":"un sacrifice","s":2077},{"t":"à l’Éternel","s":3068},{"t":", et firent","s":5087,"m":8799},{"t":"des vœux","s":5088},{"t":"."}]},{"v":17,"t":"(. ) L’Éternel fit venir un grand poisson pour engloutir Jonas, et Jonas fut dans le ventre du poisson trois jours et trois nuits.","s":[{"t":"(","s":2},{"t":".","s":1},{"t":") L’Éternel","s":3068},{"t":"fit venir","s":4487,"m":8762},{"t":"un grand","s":1419},{"t":"poisson","s":1709},{"t":"pour engloutir","s":1104,"m":8800},{"t":"Jonas","s":3124},{"t":", et Jonas","s":3124},{"t":"fut dans le ventre","s":4578},{"t":"du poisson","s":1709},{"t":"trois","s":7969},{"t":"jours","s":3117},{"t":"et trois","s":7969},{"t":"nuits","s":3915},{"t":"."}]}],"2":[{"v":1,"t":"(. ) Jonas, dans le ventre du poisson, pria l’Éternel, son Dieu.","s":[{"t":"(","s":2},{"t":".","s":2},{"t":") Jonas","s":3124},{"t":", dans le ventre","s":4578},{"t":"du poisson","s":1710},{"t":", pria","s":6419,"m":8691},{"t":"l’Éternel","s":3068},{"t":", son Dieu","s":430},{"t":"."}]},{"v":2,"t":"(. ) Il dit: Dans ma détresse, j’ai invoqué l’Éternel, Et il m’a exaucé; Du sein du séjour des morts j’ai crié, Et tu as entendu ma voix.","s":[{"t":"(","s":2},{"t":".","s":3},{"t":") Il dit","s":559,"m":8799},{"t":": Dans ma détresse","s":6869},{"t":", j’ai invoqué","s":7121,"m":8804},{