","s":1697},{"t":"de l’Éternel","s":3068},{"t":"fut adressée à Jonas","s":3124},{"t":"une seconde","s":8145},{"t":"fois, en ces mots","s":559,"m":8800},{"t":":"}]},{"v":2,"t":"Lève -toi, va à Ninive, la grande ville, et proclames -y la publication que je t’ordonne!","s":[{"t":"Lève","s":6965,"m":8798},{"t":"-toi, va","s":3212,"m":8798},{"t":"à Ninive","s":5210},{"t":", la grande","s":1419},{"t":"ville","s":5892},{"t":", et proclames","s":7121,"m":8798},{"t":"-y la publication","s":7150},{"t":"que je t’ordonne","s":1696,"m":8802},{"t":"!"}]},{"v":3,"t":"Et Jonas se leva, et alla à Ninive, selon la parole de l’Éternel. Or Ninive était une très grande ville, de trois jours de marche.","s":[{"t":"Et Jonas","s":3124},{"t":"se leva","s":6965,"m":8799},{"t":", et alla","s":3212,"m":8799},{"t":"à Ninive","s":5210},{"t":", selon la parole","s":1697},{"t":"de l’Éternel","s":3068},{"t":". Or Ninive","s":5210},{"t":"était une très","s":430},{"t":"grande","s":1419},{"t":"ville","s":5892},{"t":", de trois","s":7969},{"t":"jours","s":3117},{"t":"de marche","s":4109},{"t":"."}]},{"v":4,"t":"Jonas fit d’abord dans la ville une journée de marche; il criait et disait: Encore quarante jours, et Ninive est détruite!","s":[{"t":"Jonas","s":3124},{"t":"fit d’abord","s":2490,"m":8686},{"t":"","s":935,"m":8800},{"t":"dans la ville","s":5892},{"t":"une","s":259},{"t":"journée","s":3117},{"t":"de marche","s":4109},{"t":"; il criait","s":7121,"m":8799},{"t":"et disait","s":559,"m":8799},{"t":": Encore quarante","s":705},{"t":"jours","s":3117},{"t":", et Ninive","s":5210},{"t":"est détruite","s":2015,"m":8737},{"t":"!"}]},{"v":5,"t":"Les gens de Ninive crurent à Dieu, ils publièrent un jeûne, et se revêtirent de sacs, depuis les plus grands jusqu’aux plus petits.","s":[{"t":"Les gens","s":582},{"t":"de Ninive","s":5210},{"t":"crurent","s":539,"m":8686},{"t":"à Dieu","s":430},{"t":", ils publièrent","s":7121,"m":8799},{"t":"un jeûne","s":6685},{"t":", et se revêtirent","s":3847,"m":8799},{"t":"de sacs","s":8242},{"t":", depuis les plus grands","s":1419},{"t":"jusqu’aux plus petits","s":6996},{"t":"."}]},{"v":6,"t":"La chose parvint au roi de Ninive; il se leva de son trône, ôta son manteau, se couvrit d’un sac, et s’assit sur la cendre.","s":[{"t":"La chose","s":1697},{"t":"parvint","s":5060,"m":8799},{"t":"au roi","s":4428},{"t":"de Ninive","s":5210},{"t":"; il se leva","s":6965,"m":8799},{"t":"de son trône","s":3678},{"t":", ôta","s":5674,"m":8686},{"t":"son manteau","s":155},{"t":", se couvrit","s":3680,"m":8762},{"t":"d’un sac","s":8242},{"t":", et s’assit","s":3427,"m":8799},{"t":"sur la cendre","s":665},{"t":"."}]},{"v":7,"t":"Et il fit faire dans Ninive cette publication, par ordre du roi et de ses grands; Que les hommes et les bêtes, les bœufs et les brebis, ne goûtent de rien, ne paissent point, et ne boivent point d’eau!","s":[{"t":"Et il fit faire","s":2199,"m":8686},{"t":"dans Ninive","s":5210},{"t":"cette publication","s":559,"m":8799},{"t":"","s":559,"m":8800},{"t":", par ordre","s":2940},{"t":"du roi","s":4428},{"t":"et de ses grands","s":1419},{"t":"; Que les hommes","s":120},{"t":"et les bêtes","s":929},{"t":", les bœufs","s":1241},{"t":"et les brebis","s":6629},{"t":", ne goûtent","s":2938,"m":8799},{"t":"de rien","s":3972},{"t":", ne paissent","s":7462,"m":8799},{"t":"point, et ne boivent","s":8354,"m":8799},{"t":"point d’eau","s":4325},{"t":"!"}]},{"v":8,"t":"Que les hommes et les bêtes soient couverts de sacs, qu’ils crient à Dieu avec force, et qu’ils reviennent tous de leur mauvaise voie et des actes de violence dont leurs mains sont coupables!","s":[{"t":"Que les hommes","s":120},{"t":"et les bêtes","s":929},{"t":"soient couverts","s":3680,"m":8691},{"t":"de sacs","s":8242},{"t":", qu’ils crient","s":7121,"m":8799},{"t":"à Dieu","s":430},{"t":"avec force","s":2394},{"t":", et qu’ils reviennent","s":7725,"m":8799},{"t":"tous","s":376},{"t":"de leur mauvaise","s":7451},{"t":"voie","s":1870},{"t":"et des actes de violence","s":2555},{"t":"dont leurs mains","s":3709},{"t":"sont coupables !"}]},{"v":9,"t":"Qui sait si Dieu ne reviendra pas et ne se repentira pas, et s’il ne renoncera pas à son ardente colère, en sorte que nous ne périssions point?","s":[{"t":"Qui sait","s":3045,"m":8802},{"t":"si Dieu","s":430},{"t":"ne reviendra","s":7725,"m":8799},{"t":"pas et ne se repentira","s":5162,"m":8738},{"t":"pas, et s’il ne renoncera","s":7725,"m":8804},{"t":"pas à son ardente","s":2740},{"t":"colère","s":639},{"t":", en sorte que nous ne périssions","s":6,"m":8799},{"t":"point ?"}]},{"v":10,"t":"Dieu vit qu’ils agissaient ainsi et qu’ils revenaient de leur mauvaise voie. Alors Dieu se repentit du mal qu’il avait résolu de leur faire, et il ne le fit pas.","s":[{"t":"Dieu","s":430},{"t":"vit","s":7200,"m":8799},{"t":"qu’ils agissaient","s":4639},{"t":"ainsi et qu’ils revenaient","s":7725,"m":8804},{"t":"de leur mauvaise","s":7451},{"t":"voie","s":1870},{"t":". Alors Dieu","s":430},{"t":"se repentit","s":5162,"m":8735},{"t":"du mal","s":7451},{"t":"qu’il avait résolu","s":1696,"m":8765},{"t":"de leur faire","s":6213,"m":8800},{"t":", et il ne le fit","s":6213,"m":8804},{"t":"pas."}]}],"4":[{"v":1,"t":"Cela déplut fort à Jonas, et il fut irrité.","s":[{"t":"Cela déplut","s":3415,"m":8799},{"t":"fort","s":1419},{"t":"","s":7451},{"t":"à Jonas","s":3124},{"t":", et il fut irrité","s":2734,"m":8799},{"t":"."}]},{"v":2,"t":"Il implora l’Éternel, et il dit: Ah! Éternel, n’est-ce pas ce que je disais quand j’étais encore dans mon pays? C’est ce que je voulais prévenir en fuyant à tarsis. Car je savais que tu es un Dieu compatissant et miséricordieux, lent à la colère et riche en bonté, et qui te repens du mal.","s":[{"t":"Il implora","s":6419,"m":8691},{"t":"l’Éternel","s":3068},{"t":", et il dit","s":559,"m":8799},{"t":": Ah","s":577},{"t":"! Éternel","s":3068},{"t":", n’est-ce pas ce que je disais","s":1697},{"t":"quand j’étais encore dans mon pays","s":127},{"t":"? C’est ce que je voulais prévenir en fuyant","s":1272,"m":8800},{"t":"à","s":6923,"m":8765},{"t":"tarsis","s":8659},{"t":". Car je savais","s":3045,"m":8804},{"t":"que tu es un Dieu","s":410},{"t":"compatissant","s":2587},{"t":"et miséricordieux","s":7349},{"t":", lent","s":750},{"t":"à la colère","s":639},{"t":"et riche","s":7227},{"t":"en bonté","s":2617},{"t":", et qui te repens","s":5162,"m":8737},{"t":"du mal","s":7451},{"t":"."}]},{"v":3,"t":"Maintenant, Éternel, prends -moi donc la vie, car la mort m’est préférable à la vie.","s":[{"t":"Maintenant, Éternel","s":3068},{"t":", prends","s":3947,"m":8798},{"t":"-moi donc la vie","s":5315},{"t":", car la mort","s":4194},{"t":"m’est préférable","s":2896},{"t":"à la vie","s":2416},{"t":"."}]},{"v":4,"t":"L’Éternel répondit: Fais-tu bien de t’irriter?","s":[{"t":"L’Éternel","s":3068},{"t":"répondit","s":559,"m":8799},{"t":": Fais-tu bien","s":3190,"m":8687},{"t":"de t’irriter","s":2734,"m":8804},{"t":"?"}]},{"v":5,"t":"Et Jonas sortit de la ville, et s’assit à l’orient de la ville, Là il se fit une cabane, et s’y tint à l’ombre, jusqu’à ce qu’il vît ce qui arriverait dans la ville.","s":[{"t":"Et Jonas","s":3124},{"t":"sortit","s":3318,"m":8799},{"t":"de la ville","s":5892},{"t":", et s’assit","s":3427,"m":8799},{"t":"à l’orient","s":6924},{"t":"de la ville","s":5892},{"t":", Là il se fit","s":6213,"m":8799},{"t":"une cabane","s":5521},{"t":", et s’y tint","s":3427,"m":8799},{"t":"à l’ombre","s":6738},{"t":", jusqu’à ce qu’il vît","s":7200,"m":8799},{"t":"ce qui arriverait dans la ville","s":5892},{"t":"."}]},{"v":6,"t":"L’Éternel Dieu fit croître un ricin, qui s’éleva au-dessus de Jonas, pour donner de l’ombre sur sa tête et pour lui ôter son irritation. Jonas éprouva une grande joie à cause de ce ricin.","s":[{"t":"L’Éternel","s":3068},{"t":"Dieu","s":430},{"t":"fit croître","s":4487,"m":8762},{"t":"un ricin","s":7021},{"t":", qui s’éleva","s":5927,"m":8799},{"t":"au-dessus de Jonas","s":3124},{"t":", pour donner de l’ombre","s":6738},{"t":"sur sa tête","s":7218},{"t":"et pour lui ôter","s":5337,"m":8687},{"t":"son irritation","s":7451},{"t":". Jonas","s":3124},{"t":"éprouva une grande","s":1419},{"t":"","s":8057},{"t":"joie","s":8055,"m":8799},{"t":"à cause de ce ricin","s":7021},{"t":"."}]},{"v":7,"t":"Mais le lendemain, à l’aurore, Dieu fit venir un ver qui piqua le ricin, et le ricin sécha.","s":[{"t":"Mais le lendemain","s":4283},{"t":"","s":7837},{"t":", à l’aurore","s":5927,"m":8800},{"t":", Dieu","s":430},{"t":"fit venir","s":4487,"m":8762},{"t":"un ver","s":8438},{"t":"qui piqua","s":5221,"m":8686},{"t":"le ricin","s":7021},{"t":", et le ricin sécha","s":3001,"m":8799},{"t":"."}]},{"v":8,"t":"Au lever du soleil, Dieu fit souffler un vent chaud d’orient, et le soleil frappa la tête de Jonas, au point qu’il tomba en défaillance. Il demanda la mort, et dit: La mort m’est préférable à la vie.","s":[{"t":"Au lever","s":2224,"m":8800},{"t":"du soleil","s":8121},{"t":", Dieu","s":430},{"t":"fit souffler","s":4487,"m":8762},{"t":"un vent","s":7307},{"t":"chaud","s":2759},{"t":"d’orient","s":6921},{"t":", et le soleil","s":8121},{"t":"frappa","s":5221,"m":8686},{"t":"la tête","s":7218},{"t":"de Jonas","s":3124},{"t":", au point qu’il tomba","s":5968,"m":8691},{"t":"en défaillance. Il demanda","s":7592,"m":8799},{"t":"","s":5315},{"t":"la mort","s":4191,"m":8800},{"t":", et dit","s":559,"m":8799},{"t":": La mort","s":4194},{"t":"m’est préférable","s":2896},{"t":"à la vie","s":2416},{"t":"."}]},{"v":9,"t":"Dieu dit à Jonas: Fais-tu bien de t’irriter à cause du ricin? Il répondit: Je fais bien de m’irriter jusqu’à la mort.","s":[{"t":"Dieu","s":430},{"t":"dit","s":559,"m":8799},{"t":"à Jonas","s":3124},{"t":": Fais-tu bien","s":3190,"m":8687},{"t":"de t’irriter","s":2734,"m":8804},{"t":"à cause du ricin","s":7021},{"t":"? Il répondit","s":559,"m":8799},{"t":": Je fais bien","s":3190,"m":8687},{"t":"de m’irriter","s":2734,"m":8804},{"t":"jusqu’à la mort","s":4194},{"t":"."}]},{"v":10,"t":"Et l’Éternel dit: Tu as pitié du ricin qui ne t’a coûté aucune peine et que tu n’as pas fait croître, qui est né dans une nuit et qui a péri dans une nuit.","s":[{"t":"Et l’Éternel","s":3068},{"t":"dit","s":559,"m":8799},{"t":": Tu as pitié","s":2347,"m":8804},{"t":"du ricin","s":7021},{"t":"qui ne t’a coûté aucune peine","s":5998,"m":8804},{"t":"et que tu n’as pas fait croître","s":1431,"m":8765},{"t":", qui est né dans une nuit","s":1121},{"t":"","s":3915},{"t":"et qui a péri","s":6,"m":8804},{"t":"dans une nuit","s":1121},{"t":"","s":3915},{"t":"."}]},{"v":11,"t":"Et moi, je n’aurais pas pitié de Ninive, la grande ville, dans laquelle se trouvent plus de cent vingt mille hommes qui ne savent pas distinguer leur droite de leur gauche, et des animaux en grand nombre!","s":[{"t":"Et moi, je n’aurais pas pitié","s":2347,"m":8799},{"t":"de Ninive","s":5210},{"t":", la grande","s":1419},{"t":"ville","s":5892},{"t":", dans laquelle se trouvent","s":3426},{"t":"plus","s":7235,"m":8687},{"t":"de cent vingt","s":8147},{"t":"","s":6240},{"t":"mille","s":7239},{"t":"hommes","s":120},{"t":"qui ne savent pas distinguer","s":3045,"m":8804},{"t":"leur droite","s":3225},{"t":"de leur gauche","s":8040},{"t":", et des animaux","s":929},{"t":"en grand nombre","s":7227},{"t":"!"}]}]}}